      "lineNbr": 1966,
      "author": {
        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-23T21:47:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "[A2dp](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/a2dp/A2dpStateMachine.java;l\u003d585;drc\u003d6657bd97bd31c0cc373137c59457a552b85c9894) is doing this is the Connected state, and depending of the result of disconnectA2dp, move to disconnecting (because it expect a callback) or to disconnected (because nothing to expect)\n```\ncase DISCONNECT: {\n  Log.i(TAG, \"Disconnecting from \" + mDevice);\n  if (!mA2dpNativeInterface.disconnectA2dp(mDevice)) {\n      // If error in the native stack, transition directly to Disconnected state.\n      Log.e(TAG, \"Connected: error disconnecting from \" + mDevice);\n      transitionTo(mDisconnected);\n      break;\n  }\n  transitionTo(mDisconnecting);\n}\n```\n\nIt is similar for [HeadsetStateMachine.java](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/hfp/HeadsetStateMachine.java;l\u003d1324;drc\u003da007dcd33e1e0a1c2cdf8ec79119970a36837bd1) (but they don\u0027t go to disconnected directly, instead they say connected... weird, i don\u0027t know the history there)\n\nSame for [LeAudioStateMachine](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioStateMachine.java;l\u003d477;drc\u003dfe2c86b638cc53f84c242d7a7856d6a4bc7d699d), [Hap](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/hap/HapClientStateMachine.java;l\u003d578;drc\u003dabb39b5d7b2706ed8c735459838f6162d26c4443)\n\nI strongly believe that having the logic in the onEnter is going against the concept pattern of a state machine.",
      "parentUuid": "b9fd0ee5_9e0c4253",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1966,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 1966,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "f352c31c5318c9a810f7095a88a04deaf24fe355",
