      "side": 1,
      "message": "I respectfully disagree here too! If it was a bad thing, they wouldn\u0027t let us do it 😊\n\nI think its totally fine to enter the state and queue up an immediate transition out of it if there\u0027s no work to do. It helps enforce consistency in state change broadcasts and the clean up process in this case. If anything, its elegant.",
