      "writtenOn": "2024-10-24T22:09:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Wouldn\u0027t it be better to do\n```\nConnectedState {\n[...]\n  transitionTo(mDisconnecting);\n  sendEmptyMessage(DISCONNECT);\n}\n```\n\nThat way, you move to disconnecting, but there is already the message queued that will let you go into disconnected, without relying on the `Enter` to do extra logic \u0026 check on how it get here.",
