      "writtenOn": "2024-10-23T21:06:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi William, we still would want the disconnecting state regardless of what is happening on the native end. Here are two profiles that transition from disconnecting to disconnected during the onEnter phase:\nAvrcpControllerStateMachine (http://ac/packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/avrcpcontroller/AvrcpControllerStateMachine.java?l\u003d1190)\n\nMceStateMachine (https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/mapclient/MceStateMachine.java;l\u003d1256)\n\nFor the error message you mentioned, we don\u0027t see this on our end",
      "parentUuid": "7cef5a36_58a3cd98",
      "range": {
